*.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Probe output nothing reads. silpo_branches.json is 1 MB of branch records that
# served its purpose once (picking the Vinnytsia branch ID, now in config.py).
# atb_stores.json is a dud — the ?chain=atb filter was ignored, so it is a
# byte-identical copy of zakaz_stores.json. Safe to delete outright.
tests/fixtures/silpo_branches.json
tests/fixtures/atb_stores.json

# Editors / envs
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Everything else under tests/fixtures/ is COMMITTED ON PURPOSE. Those files are
# inputs, not artifacts:
#   - test_adapters.py parses 5 of them offline; without them the suite cannot
#     run on a fresh clone, and they are the only defence against a silent
#     upstream HTML/JSON change.
#   - atb_categories.txt is read at RUNTIME by `price_comparator categories`,
#     so it is not test-only despite living in tests/.
#   - zakaz_stores.json is the lookup table for adding more chains later.
